@startuml cicd
!include style.puml
skinparam ranksep 26

rectangle "**push to main**" as P $accentBg
rectangle "**CI**\n<size:11><color:$dim>lint · types · 264 tests</color></size>" as CI
rectangle "**Quality gate**\n<size:11><color:$dim>recall ≥ 0.70  ·  MRR ≥ 0.60</color></size>\n<size:11><color:$dim>injection blocked = 100%</color></size>" as GATE $accentBg
rectangle "**Regression → build fails**\n<size:11><color:$dim>nothing is shipped</color></size>" as FAIL $badBg
rectangle "**Build**\n<size:11><color:$dim>ARM64 image → ECR, via an</color></size>\n<size:11><color:$dim>OIDC role with no stored keys</color></size>" as BUILD
rectangle "**Deploy**\n<size:11><color:$dim>ECS rolling update</color></size>" as DEP
rectangle "**Smoke test**\n<size:11><color:$dim>/health</color></size>" as SMOKE $goodBg

P     -down->      CI
CI    -down->      GATE
GATE  -right[$bad]-> FAIL
GATE  -down->      BUILD
BUILD -down->      DEP
DEP   -down->      SMOKE

note right of BUILD
  Deploy triggers on workflow_run,
  never on a raw push: a commit that
  fails the gate is never even built.
end note
@enduml
